Explain the rendering process in Angular (change detection )
  Angular rendering process is depends on change detection. when an event,API response, timer, or observable updates the data, the component marked to be verified. angular runs the change detection cyle and compares new value with previous values.
by default it will check every component in the component tree. but for better performances we will use onpush mechanism, trackb and async pipe to reduce unnecessary checks.


